Feature: AI-Expert Integration
  As a user of the ai-suite
  I want the ai-expert role to be deeply integrated into the core workflows
  So that my prompts are automatically optimized and suite enhancements are reviewed for quality.

  Scenario: AI-Expert is involved in the Reflection Protocol
    Given the ai-suite reflection protocol
    When the AI edits a skill or template
    Then the AI-Expert role must be assumed to review the enhancement
    And confirm it improves the AI agent's working capabilities

  Scenario: AI-Expert is involved in the Global Workflow
    Given the ai-suite global block
    When the AI agent starts a complex task
    Then it should automatically apply the ai-expert skill to analyze and optimize the user's request

  Scenario: AI-Expert is involved in Team Processes
    Given the tdd-team or autonomous-team process
    When the PM defines the requirements
    Then the PM must consult the AI-Expert role to optimize the initial prompt and requirements
